# === Champion reproduction whitelist ===
# These .npy files are checkpoints required by mk_6d's sweep.
# Without them, the champion submission cannot be regenerated
# from a fresh clone in the 3-command quickstart.
!model_tests/mk_6b/models/mk_6b_*_test_proba.npy
!model_tests/mk_6d/experiments/6d1_weight_sweep/val_data/*.npy
